# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Never translate line endings.
#
#  This archive mixes source code with data files whose bytes must survive a
#  clone unchanged: *.pgm face images (network samples are huge), *.pdf/*.png
#  figures, *.mexw64 binaries, *.tns test data.  Git's system config on the
#  author's machine is core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite CRLF on
#  checkout and silently corrupt them.  `* -text` stores and restores the
#  working bytes verbatim.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* -text

# explicit, so diff/merge never tries to treat these as text
*.pgm     binary
*.mat     binary
*.pdf     binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.mexw64  binary
*.tns     binary
